    "detailed_description": "Pac and Bomber: Maze Blast&quot; is an electrifying arcade game that merges fast-paced maze navigation with clever bomb placement strategies. Players guide Pac or Bomber through a series of increasingly complex labyrinths, deploying bombs to clear paths and outmanoeuvre a variety of cunning enemies. Each level introduces new challenges and power-ups that enhance gameplay, from speed boosts to shield protectors, increasing range of your bombs to increasing Pac's chase mode time. &quot;Pac and Bomber: Maze Blast&quot; offers endless hours of explosive fun and thrilling puzzle-solving action.<br><br>World 1 Maze # Unknown :)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/46fe0d5411fb99cf2ff4e2ab2f010ae0.avif?t=1720949044\" width=512 height=346 /></span><br><br>Eat or Blow your Enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/771a24c3cd4be6791dd6e363fecf78f1.poster.avif?t=1720949044\" width=512 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/771a24c3cd4be6791dd6e363fecf78f1.webm?t=1720949044\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/771a24c3cd4be6791dd6e363fecf78f1.mp4?t=1720949044\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Variety of enemies - This one weaving webs to trap you, at time his own colleagues too :)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/525a55c1630f0191c7469764b06097b1.poster.avif?t=1720949044\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2945970/extras/525a55c16